# Auxiliary cross-project symlinks (e.g. agentic-development) — local only.
# Track only local skill/command symlinks; everything else under these dirs
# (incl. agentic-development cross-links) stays untracked.
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/brainstorming
!/.claude/skills/docx
!/.claude/skills/hooks-creator
!/.claude/skills/marp-slide
